{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get an early look at <i>Continuum Keeper</i> in this exclusive demo. Monitor surveillance cameras across unstable timelines and alternate realities, and identify Fractures\u2014distortions in space-time that threaten the fabric of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One playable level: a remote gas station  affected by reality shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core surveillance and Fracture detection gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early access to fragments of the game's lore and mystery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the tension of observation-based horror while uncovering the first pieces of a larger story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693110?t=1747453090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693110?t=1747453090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693110/96859f930bbe3a8931c6f62aa3ab3c8b4bca2668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747453090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693110/96859f930bbe3a8931c6f62aa3ab3c8b4bca2668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747453090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements, including disturbing imagery, surreal distortions of reality, and themes of existential dread. Some players may find the content unsettling or anxiety-inducing. It may also feature blood and other disturbing visuals."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get an early look at <i>Continuum Keeper</i> in this exclusive demo. Monitor surveillance cameras across unstable timelines and alt